---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="圖鑑出版｜中國高古帝陵玉器珍寶｜中鼎文物">
  <section class="page-heading dark"><span class="eyebrow gold">PUBLICATION & READING</span><h1>圖鑑出版</h1><p>從影像到文字，<br/>保留每一次細看的線索。</p></section>
  <section class="section publication-preview publication-full"><div class="book-image"><img src="/images/zd-034.webp" alt="中國高古帝陵玉器珍寶書封" width="650" height="880" /></div><div><span class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATED CATALOGUE</span><h2>中國高古帝陵<br/>玉器珍寶</h2><p class="lead">透過藏品全貌、局部細節與文字介紹，閱讀器型、紋飾及雕刻結構。</p><dl class="book-meta"><div><dt>主編</dt><dd>周明謙</dd></div><div><dt>副主編</dt><dd>蔡建新</dd></div><div><dt>出版者</dt><dd>北星圖書事業股份有限公司</dd></div><div><dt>初版</dt><dd>2016 年 6 月</dd></div><div><dt>ISBN</dt><dd>978-986-6399-47-3</dd></div></dl><a class="button dark-button" href="/contact/?topic=圖鑑出版">洽詢圖鑑</a><p class="small-note">出版資訊依所提供之版權頁整理；購書與庫存狀況請洽詢確認。</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">INSIDE THE BOOK</span><h2>紙頁中的典藏</h2></div><p>以下影像為圖鑑頁面，<br/>可進入個別選輯欣賞與閱讀。</p></div><div class="book-pages">{[['zd-029','鏤空龍紋神人大璧'],['zd-031','鏤雕皇后鳳冠'],['zd-033','龍首雙連璜']].map(([id,name])=><a href={'/collection/'+id+'/'}><img src={'/images/'+id+'.webp'} alt={name+'圖鑑頁'} width="580" height="800" loading="lazy" /><h3>{name}</h3></a>)}</div></section>
</Layout>
